<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sort</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">sort</ansi> command moves crafting materials from your
backpack into your equipped component bag.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">sort</ansi>     Move all crafting materials into your bag.

You must have a component bag equipped in the Components slot.
Materials are items flagged as crafting components (ores, herbs,
leather, binding paste, gemstones, etc.).

When you pick up or buy crafting materials, they automatically
go into your component bag if one is equipped and has space.
The <ansi fg="command">sort</ansi> command is for organizing materials that were
already in your backpack before you equipped the bag.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help inventory</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
